    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroyer in Miraculous Storm is a Touhou Project bullet hell STG fan game presented by \u5e7b\u7f18\u5236\u4f5c\u7ec4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new original story weaving ancient myths with fresh conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimu, Marisa and Wakasagihime, the three playable heroines will face the secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge the bullets, shootdown enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go against the storm, face the core of the incident.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643310/extras/21e14e13a144f170bfa5b06894f05e5a.avif?t=1752724019\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gensoukyo, the forgotten paradise of Youkais and Gods. Its inhabitants were meant to enjoy a leisurely summer... or so it should have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden storm that lasted all day brought torrential rains, like a cascading waterfall. The relentless downpour stirred unease among all living beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unprecedented mystery demands to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey with shrine maidens and allies to battle through the unknown. Those who have voyaged across the long time itself may await you at the story's conclusion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643310/extras/343dcc9ae0b76b1732f2bbe1e0c384f0.avif?t=1752724019\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original styled vertical-scrolling bullet hell STG with all 6+EX stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moderate yet vibrant bullet patterns await you on the journey to solve incident.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve a path through the storm of curtains by harnessing the power of Skyflow with brand-new &quot;Skyflow Spell.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic music composed by both rising talents and seasoned veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly to\u00a0first-time players, with simple systems and configurations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interesting story with many characters, filled with well-researched lore, homages, imagination, and passion.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroyer in Miraculous Storm is a Touhou Project bullet hell STG fan game presented by \u5e7b\u7f18\u5236\u4f5c\u7ec4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new original story weaving ancient myths with fresh conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimu, Marisa and Wakasagihime, the three playable heroines will face the secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge the bullets, shootdown enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go against the storm, face the core of the incident.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643310/extras/21e14e13a144f170bfa5b06894f05e5a.avif?t=1752724019\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gensoukyo, the forgotten paradise of Youkais and Gods. Its inhabitants were meant to enjoy a leisurely summer... or so it should have been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden storm that lasted all day brought torrential rains, like a cascading waterfall. The relentless downpour stirred unease among all living beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unprecedented mystery demands to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey with shrine maidens and allies to battle through the unknown. Those who have voyaged across the long time itself may await you at the story's conclusion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643310/extras/343dcc9ae0b76b1732f2bbe1e0c384f0.avif?t=1752724019\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original styled vertical-scrolling bullet hell STG with all 6+EX stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moderate yet vibrant bullet patterns await you on the journey to solve incident.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve a path through the storm of curtains by harnessing the power of Skyflow with brand-new &quot;Skyflow Spell.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic music composed by both rising talents and seasoned veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly to\u00a0first-time players, with simple systems and configurations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interesting story with many characters, filled with well-researched lore, homages, imagination, and passion.</p></li></ul>",
